from the approvals app.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.550
Rich approval
applications can be built

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:46.650
in minutes using AppSheet.

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:50.520
The order is then routed to
the warehouse for fulfillment,

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:53.760
and the ops team gets
notified via Google Chat.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.190
Finally, an invoice
for this order

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:59.220
